<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2033878965"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1677276654"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="花曇り"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="佐藤千亜妃"/><amll:meta key="album" value="花曇り"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:02.633"><div begin="00:00.784" end="03:57.564"><p begin="00:00.784" end="00:03.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">あなただけを見てた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当唯独注视着你的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta da ke wo mi te ta</span></p><p begin="00:03.483" end="00:05.976" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">あの花が咲く頃<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那朵花悄然绽放</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ha na ga sa ku ko ro</span></p><p begin="00:06.208" end="00:11.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">届かぬ想いを育てて束ねた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悉心培育的无法传抵的思念 捆扎成束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ka nu o mo i wo so da te te ta ba ne ta</span></p><p begin="00:11.609" end="00:14.064" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">手放した分だけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是否只有我忍心放手离去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te ba na shi ta bu n da ke</span></p><p begin="00:14.385" end="00:16.951" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">いつか笑えるかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一日才能绽放笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka wa ra e ru ka na</span></p><p begin="00:17.146" end="00:23.508" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">あなたがいない春 巡ってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你的春日 徒然流转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ga i na i ha ru me gu 't te ku</span></p><p begin="00:35.000" end="00:41.673" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">風の冷たさに身震いして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在刺骨凛冽的风中阵阵发抖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze no tsu me ta sa ni mi bu ru i shi te</span></p><p begin="00:42.566" end="00:45.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">早く帰りたくなる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">叫人愈发归心似箭</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ya ku ka e ri ta ku na ru</span></p><p begin="00:45.913" end="00:52.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">ジャンクフードテイクアウトして2人で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下单快餐打包带走</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ja n ku fu u do te i ku a u to shi te</span></p><p begin="00:53.535" end="00:56.331" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">毛布の中 眠りたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要裹着毛毯入睡</span></p><p begin="00:56.331" end="01:03.668" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">あなたに届けなんてもう思わないのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想把自己的心意告诉你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ni to do ke na n te</span></p><p begin="01:04.384" end="01:07.184" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">記憶だけ裏切るよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记忆却与决心背道而驰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki o ku da ke u ra gi ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:07.217" end="01:14.497" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">明日になればきっと大丈夫なんてさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等到明天就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta ni na re ba</span></p><p begin="01:15.287" end="01:18.266" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">曇り空が言う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阴沉的天空如此说道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku mo ri zo ra ga i u</span></p><p begin="01:18.535" end="01:20.957" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">あなただけを見てた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当唯独注视着你的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta da ke wo mi te ta</span></p><p begin="01:21.173" end="01:23.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">あの花が咲く頃<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那朵花悄然绽放</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ha na ga sa ku ko ro</span></p><p begin="01:23.949" end="01:29.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">届かぬ想いを育てて束ねた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悉心培育的无法传抵的思念 捆扎成束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ka nu o mo i wo so da te te ta ba ne ta</span></p><p begin="01:29.358" end="01:31.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">渡しそびれたまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却没能交赠予你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi so bi re ta ma ma</span></p><p begin="01:32.068" end="01:34.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">大人になっていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们便都长大成人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to na ni na 't te i ta</span></p><p begin="01:34.840" end="01:41.181" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">あなたがいない春 巡ってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你的春日 徒然流转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ga i na i ha ru me gu 't te ku</span></p><p begin="01:44.530" end="01:51.151" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">季節外れの花みたいな気持ちを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使这份心意犹如不合时宜的花</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki se tsu ha zu re no ha na mi ta i na ki mo chi wo</span></p><p begin="01:52.175" end="01:55.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">捨てられずにいたけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我却依然难以割舍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su te ra re zu ni i ta ke do</span></p><p begin="01:55.526" end="02:02.265" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">センチメンタルに浸るのも飽きたし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉浸于多愁善感的时日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se n chi me n ta ru ni hi ta ru no mo</span></p><p begin="02:03.093" end="02:05.934" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">優しい声 聴いてたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眷恋你温柔的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya sa shi i ko e ki i te ta i</span></p><p begin="02:05.934" end="02:13.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">あなたじゃない人と出逢わなければまだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心想必须要与除你之外的他人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ja na i hi to to</span></p><p begin="02:13.855" end="02:16.696" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">思い出に閉じこもり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可仍然将自己囚禁于回忆之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i de ni to ji ko mo ri</span></p><p begin="02:16.726" end="02:24.466" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">愛され方すら知らないままだったよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至连被爱的方式</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i sa re ka ta su ra</span></p><p begin="02:24.784" end="02:27.706" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">お互い様ね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们果然彼此彼此呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ta ga i sa ma ne</span></p><p begin="02:28.010" end="02:30.551" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">生きてゆく意味など<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所谓活着的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te yu ku i mi na do</span></p><p begin="02:30.675" end="02:33.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">変わりゆくものだと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实会逐渐改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ri yu ku mo no da to</span></p><p begin="02:33.481" end="02:38.742" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">傷が癒えてゆく時間が教える<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像时间总能治愈伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu ga i e te yu ku ji ka n ga o shi e ru</span></p><p begin="02:38.895" end="02:41.446" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">幸せじゃないふり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无法装作难过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a wa se ja na i fu ri</span></p><p begin="02:41.642" end="02:44.175" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">出来なくてごめんね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对不起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de ki na ku te go me n ne</span></p><p begin="02:44.372" end="02:50.523" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">あなたの横顔が霞んでく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的侧脸逐渐朦胧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no yo ko ga o ga ka su n de ku</span></p><p begin="03:12.939" end="03:15.537" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">この花びらが蝶の<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若这抹花瓣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ha na bi ra ga cho u no</span></p><p begin="03:15.684" end="03:18.263" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">羽だとしたならば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能够成为蝴蝶的羽翼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ne da to shi ta na ra ba</span></p><p begin="03:18.475" end="03:20.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">どこか遠いとこに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想将它放飞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ka to o i to ko ni</span></p><p begin="03:20.837" end="03:23.755" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">飛ばしてしまいたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自由展翅飞向千里之外</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ba shi te shi ma i ta i</span></p><p begin="03:23.945" end="03:26.363" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">いつかした約束<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾几何时立下的约定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka shi ta ya ku so ku</span></p><p begin="03:26.632" end="03:29.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">覚えててごめんね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抱歉我还没忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o bo e te te go me n ne</span></p><p begin="03:29.237" end="03:34.798" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">散る花びらを風が攫ってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">掠过的风将凋零的花瓣裹挟而去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ru ha na bi ra wo ka ze ga sa ra 't te ku</span></p><p begin="03:34.838" end="03:37.298" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">あなただけを見てた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当唯独注视着你的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta da ke wo mi te ta</span></p><p begin="03:37.544" end="03:40.063" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">あの花が咲く頃<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那朵花悄然绽放</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ha na ga sa ku ko ro</span></p><p begin="03:40.271" end="03:45.532" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">届かぬ想いを育てて束ねた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悉心培育的无法传抵的思念 捆扎成束</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ka nu o mo i wo so da te te ta ba ne ta</span></p><p begin="03:45.698" end="03:48.217" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">手放した分だけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是否只有我忍心放手离去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te ba na shi ta bu n da ke</span></p><p begin="03:48.477" end="03:50.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">いつか笑えるかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一日才能绽放笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka wa ra e ru ka na</span></p><p begin="03:51.174" end="03:57.564" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">あなたがいない春 巡ってく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你的春日 徒然流转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ga i na i ha ru me gu 't te ku</span></p></div></body></tt>